      "writtenOn": "2026-01-06T12:21:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we pad the buffers on creation to have a size that\u0027s a multiple of 4? This way we can always capture the full contents, only with some trailing bytes that the replay would just ignore.",
      "revId": "3e5874baab36da91c0c3555886604b588c35c07a",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
